        },
        {
          title: 'What the tests changed in the design',
          body: 'Tables and paragraphs needed repair before chunking, while their relationships could still be recovered. Repeated note numbers also meant that a number alone could not identify the right note, so the linker used position and surrounding context. I checked the final chunks for the rule and its qualification together, because that was the evidence an answer would depend on.'
        }
      ]
    };
  },
};
</script>

